  "details": "1. Open VRChat Mobile on an iPhone 15 Pro.\n\n2. Log in and enter any world, including lightweight worlds.\n\n3. Observe the frame rate and device temperature.\n\n4. The frame rate drops significantly, and the device becomes unusually hot.\n\n5. The issue occurs even in lightweight worlds.\n\n6. Before the recent update, the same device and worlds ran smoothly.\n\n7. The issue persists after updating to Build 1920.\n\nAdditional Information\n\nDevice: iPhone 15 Pro\n\nBuild: 1920\n\nObserved FPS: ~3 FPS\n\nPing: ~97–109 ms",
